  "description": "Marine Biologist, Larissa Talcott is torn between a re-newed love relationship with attorney, Brian Liam, because Brian's law firm is representing a company plotting to renovate a local pond into commercial property. Larissa is driven to stop them in order to protect the ecosystem that inhabits the pond; she is given the nickname \"Frog Princess\" by her friends and colleagues. Will Brian and Larissa compromise their firm beliefs for the sake of their relationship?\nSource: EigoMANGA",
